<question type="description"><name><text>Module 3 · Lesson 11 · Section 6: Vocabulary (Healing, Nature, Community)</text></name><questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<h3>Section 6: Vocabulary (Healing, Nature, Community)</h3>
